OL,4,CCathedral's staff review 'difficult    
OL,5,Cbut necessary'                         
OL,6,GThere will be no compulsory            
OL,7,Gredundancies at a cathedral despite a  
OL,8,Grestructure of staff, leaders have     
OL,9,Gsaid.                                  
OL,11,FGloucester Cathedral, which costs      
OL,12,Fabout #10,500 a day to open, has been  
OL,13,Fundergoing an organisational           
OL,14,Frestructure due to rising costs as     
OL,15,Fsome staff have opted for voluntary    
OL,16,Fredundancies.                          
OL,18,FIt comes after cathedral bosses across 
OL,19,Fthe West of England said they had also 
OL,20,Fbeen feeling the pinch, forcing them   
OL,21,Fto find creative ways to raise money.  
